data: {"id": "332d7ff0f1644f03-thinking-parallel_evidence-930", "run_id": "332d7ff0f1644f03", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 证据结论\n\n### 实体身份与生命周期\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974`，UID `9de01e2a-aa28-4619-947b-d99f9a8a8897`\n- **当前状态**: **`Pending`** / **`ContainerCreating`** (持续异常，未恢复)\n- **调度**: 已分配到 **`node2` (10.2.0.50)**，`PodScheduled=True`\n- **控制器**: ReplicaSet `workload-5b5fc86c8c` → Deployment `workload`\n- **容器**: `app`，镜像 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，未启动 (Container ID 为空)，重启 0 次\n- **Pod IP**: **未分配** (empty)\n\n### 关键事实：根因证据\n**直接原因已确认：ConfigMap 缺失导致 Volume 挂载失败，进而阻止容器创", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789045336706, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

