data: {"id": "332d7ff0f1644f03-final", "run_id": "332d7ff0f1644f03", "seq": 935, "ts_ms": 1789045353387, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974` | ContainerCreating | Pod workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974 处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态，容器未启动且无法分配 IP。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `FailedMount ... MountVolume.SetUp failed for volume \"input\" : configmap \"unavailable-config\" not found` (fact-7d033af0b97d) | 直接定位挂载失败原因：依赖的 ConfigMap 缺失 |\n| 2 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason: ContainerCreating` (fact-48f732c4e05b) | 确认容器处于挂载卷等待状态，未进入启动阶段 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.status: Pending` (fact-6cfc02b4006d) | 确认 Pod 整体调度停留在 Pending 阶段，未变为 Running |\n| 4 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Unable to attach or mount volumes: unmounted volumes=[input]` (fact-dc7c19dc74e4) | 证实挂载操作超时失败，卷 'input' 始终处于未挂载状态 |\n| 5 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason=1` (reason: ContainerCreating, fact-4b153d5f1c3a) | 从监控指标角度验证容器确实处于 ContainerCreating 等待态 |\n\n**证据印证：**\nK8s 事件与状态直接展示了失败原因，Metric 佐证了持续等待的状态。Logging 和 Tracing 因容器未启动而被标记为 `not_applicable`，符合逻辑，无证据冲突。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nConfigMap 'unavailable-config' 不存在 → Pod 引用该 ConfigMap 作为必需 Volume 'input' → kubelet MountVolume.SetUp 失败并超时 → 容器处于 ContainerCreating/Pending 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n**已确认的根因：Pod 配置中声明的 Volume 'input' 引用了不存在的 ConfigMap 'unavailable-config'，且未配置为 Optional 挂载。**\n\n证据编号 #1 和 #4 明确显示 kubelet 在执行 `MountVolume.SetUp` 时因找不到 ConfigMap 而报错，并持续尝试挂载导致超时（`timed out waiting for the condition`）。由于 Volume 挂载是容器启动的前置步骤，这一步的失败直接阻塞了容器创建，导致 Pod 维持在 `ContainerCreating` 和 `Pending` 状态（证据编号 #2、#3）。证据编号 #5 的 Metric 数据与 K8s 状态一致，排除了其他瞬态因素。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 18.4s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 35.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974: 35.6s (Evidence 27.7s, RCA 7.8s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-03/workload-5b5fc86c8c-xn974**: pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 62.761, "metrics": {"run_id": "332d7ff0f1644f03", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 62.767629623413086, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "39%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed, pod-sandbox-create-failed", "pass": true, "score": 0.85, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.09}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.06}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 0.8, "weighted_score": 0.12, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "已匹配（未识别核心）"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 62767.629623413086, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 59193.94779205322, "tool_calls": 15, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 3, "successful_tool_calls": 13, "failed_tool_calls": 2, "tool_duration_ms": 8266.40605926513